**Logic:** loop `i` from 1 to 99; if `i % 7 == 0` and `i % 3 != 0`, add it to `sum` and increment `count`.

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main(void)
{
    int i, sum = 0, count = 0;

    for (i = 1; i < 100; i++)
    {
        if (i % 7 == 0 && i % 3 != 0)
        {
            printf("%d ", i);
