Enter name and roll no of student 2: Kavya 12
Enter marks of 5 subjects: 85 78 92 88 81
Aman (Roll 11): average = 75.00
Kavya (Roll 12): average = 84.80
Highest average: Kavya
```
Check: $(70+80+90+60+75)/5 = 375/5 = 75.00$ and $(85+78+92+88+81)/5 = 424/5 = 84.80$.

