| 3 | 11 (42 > 40, hire) | 52 | 22 | 30 | 62 | 72 |
| 4 | 11 | 45 | 22 | 23 | 84 | 95 |
| 5 | 11 | 23 | 22 | 1 | 106 | 96 |
| 6 | 11 (96 < 106, no hire) | 10 | 10 | 0 | 116 | 96 |

