Inside swap() before swapping: a = 10, b = 20
Inside swap() after swapping : a = 20, b = 10
In main() after calling swap() : x = 10, y = 20
```
The values are swapped inside `swap()` but main still has x = 10, y = 20. To change main's variables, pointers must be passed (`swap(&x, &y)` with `void swap(int *, int *)`).

