| day | value | total | odd? | best |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | 30 | 30 | no | 0 0 |
| 2 | 45 | 75 | yes | 75 2 |
| 3 | 20 | 95 | yes | 95 3 |
| 4 | 9 | 104 | no | 95 3 |

