**Given:** TA = 5% of basic, HRA = 10% of basic. **To find:** total salary.

$$\text{Total} = \text{Basic} + 0.05\,\text{Basic} + 0.10\,\text{Basic} = 1.15 \times \text{Basic}$$

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main()
{
    unsigned int basic;
    float ta, hra, total;
    printf("Enter basic salary: ");
    scanf("%u", &basic);
    ta    = 0.05f * basic;      /* 5%  of basic */
    hra   = 0.10f * basic;      /* 10% of basic */
    total = basic + ta + hra;
    printf("\nTA = %.2f\nHRA = %.2f\nTotal salary = %.2f\n", ta, hra, total);
    return 0;
}
```

**Sample run** (input `20000`):
```
Enter basic salary: 
TA = 1000.00
HRA = 2000.00
Total salary = 23000.00
```

